<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo Securities raises KNP BT to a Buy.</title>
<headline>Rabo Securities raises KNP BT to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of February research.</p>
<p>Company-------------Sector------------Price---Broker-----------</p>
<p>    KNP BT	    Paper/packaging   41.00   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (upgraded from Hold)</p>
<p>KNP BT's 1996 figures fully in line with estimates. After analysts meeting we raised 1997 and 1999 estimates, 1998 estimate unchanged. Upgrade to Buy because we think KNP BT will outperform in 1997. Compared with Dutch market P/E is too low as cyclical paper business is only 16 pct of company's estimated 1997 turnover. With expected improvement in operations and EPS we think KNP BT shares are undervalued.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1997		   3.20    (3.10)    12.8    1.40</p>
<p>    1998		   4.50    (4.50)     9.1    1.60</p>
<p>    1999		   5.00    (4.50)     8.2    1.75</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
